{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14354040","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14354040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1435404001:1":{"text":"아이, 술만 마시지 말고 안주 삼을 얘기도 좀 해봐!","source_cn":"哎呀，别光喝酒了，快来说点什么下酒吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93950DE8F131DD87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1435404002:0":{"text":"그거 들었어? 플린의 그 길고 복잡한 계획... 완전 망했다더라!","source_cn":"你听说了吗？弗林那个特别漫长特别复杂的计划好像——完蛋啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A33EC750BEEC6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1435404003:0":{"text":"그거? 난 진작에 그렇게 될 줄 알았어!","source_cn":"嗨，这有什么，早就知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x892953C9FD69934D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1435404004:1":{"text":"애초에 계획을 세울 때부터 대차게 망할 줄 알았다니까!","source_cn":"都不用等他彻底失败，就他刚开始计划的时候，我就觉得这事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC67A1279700466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1435404005:1":{"text":"헥토르니 둔가엘이니, 화산의 저주니... 처음에는 저주받은 마법 반지를 7개 정도는 만들 생각인가 싶었어!","source_cn":"什么赫托啊杜恩加尔啊火山啊诅咒啊的，我还以为要铸造七枚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9736E501BE34DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1435404005":{"text":"헥토르니 둔가엘이니, 화산의 저주니... 처음에는 저주받은 마법 반지를 7개 정도는 만들 생각인가 싶었어!","source_cn":"什么赫托啊杜恩加尔啊火山啊诅咒啊的，我还以为要铸造七枚有诅咒的魔法戒指呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9736E501BE34DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1435404006:1":{"text":"그렇지? 그리고 뾰쪽귀들 얘기도 들어봤을걸!","source_cn":"那当然，还有更耳熟的，就是那帮尖耳朵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA21D5FD0134E0A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1435404008:1":{"text":"7개? 아, 알겠다. 그 일곱 멍청이들 얘긴가?","source_cn":"七枚？我知道了，你是说那七个蠢货吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17A437717DD529C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1435404009:1":{"text":"맞아, 그 녀석들이야! 너도 들어봤지? 그 일곱 미치광이들!","source_cn":"对吧，就是他们，你也听说了？那七个家伙简直疯了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A7A2C1C0673587A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1435404009":{"text":"맞아, 그 녀석들이야! 너도 들어봤지? 그 일곱 미치광이들!","source_cn":"对吧，就是他们，你也听说了？那七个家伙简直疯了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A7A2C1C0673587A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1435404010:0":{"text":"키 큰 여자랑 같이 살겠다고 사과까지 갖다 바쳤대잖아...","source_cn":"听说他们居然让一个高个子女孩住在家里，还给她送苹果什么的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0C8EAFC51EEAF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1435404011:1":{"text":"아니지, 아니지. 사과는 그 여자 계모가 먹인거고. 계모도 키가 크다던데?","source_cn":"不是不是，送苹果的是那女孩的后妈，也是个高个子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x035D3FA646CE95B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1435404012:1":{"text":"진짜 이해할 수 없네. 역시 덩치 큰 장신족이랑 엮이면 좋은 일 생길 리가 없다니까.","source_cn":"真的有毛病，要我说，跟那帮娇滴滴的长身人扯上关系，绝对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1735A836EBE8D3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1435404013:1":{"text":"근데 내가 듣기론 걔를 어디 높은 탑에 가뒀다던데? 다른 사람이랑 얘기하려면 머리카락을 내려줘야 한대...","source_cn":"但我听说，他们是把那女孩给关在了前所未有的高塔上，她只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B2FC9E49D8131B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1435404014:1":{"text":"차라리 드워프랑 지내는 게 낫겠다. 적어도 수염은 멋지잖아!","source_cn":"那还不如去找个矮人呢，至少矮人的胡子足够迷人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFEDA7DB0BF958B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_